OL,3,AMillions lose access to benefits and
OL,4,Apensions services after 'cyber
OL,5,Aincident'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMillions of people have been left
OL,8,Fwithout access to online benefits and
OL,9,Fpensions services after the government
OL,10,Fsaid its system had been hit by a
OL,11,F"cyber incident".
OL,13,FDowning Street has not ruled out an
OL,14,Fattempted hack but said there was
OL,15,F"currently no evidence" personal data
OL,16,Fhad been lost, adding an investigation
OL,17,Fwas ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
