OL,3,AMillions lose access to benefits and
OL,4,Apensions services after 'cyber
OL,5,Aincident'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,8,F(DWP) said it took the digital services
OL,9,Fdown as a "precaution", and assured
OL,10,Fclaimants regular benefit and pension
OL,11,Fpayments would be paid.
OL,13,FBut a number of benefits recipients say
OL,14,Fmoney they rely on has still not come
OL,15,Fthrough - and they fear being penalised
OL,16,Ffor not being able to fill in an online
OL,17,Fjournal that proves they are looking
OL,18,Ffor jobs.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
