OL,3,AZelensky criticises 'strange'
OL,4,ATrump-Putin friendship in BBC interview
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolodymyr Zelensky has voiced deep
OL,7,Ffrustration with the US, criticising
OL,8,FDonald Trump for calling Vladimir Putin
OL,9,F"my friend" and saying delays in
OL,10,Fdelivering vital anti-ballistic
OL,11,Fmissiles were costing Ukrainian lives.
OL,13,FIn an interview with the BBC at his
OL,14,Fcentral Kyiv office, Ukraine's
OL,15,Fpresident complained the US was not
OL,16,Fpushing Russia hard enough in peace
OL,17,Ftalks, and called it "strange" that
OL,18,FTrump posted a photo of himself
OL,19,Fembracing Putin.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
