OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZelensky criticises 'strange'
OL,4,ATrump-Putin friendship in BBC interview
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Of course it's up to the president of
OL,7,Fthe United States, but... it's
OL,8,Fstrange," Zelensky said, speaking in
OL,9,FEnglish.
OL,11,F"He's an aggressor, and a killer... He
OL,12,Fcan't be a friend. Just cannot be," he
OL,13,Fsaid, adding it was like saying you
OL,14,Fwere friends with Adolf Hitler during
OL,15,FWorld War Two.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
